title: "Schwarzschild one-particle and Kasner fixed-point reproducibility"
type: software
version: 1.3.0
date-released: 2026-11-10
authors:
  - family-names: Villatoro
    given-names: Francisco R.
    affiliation: Universidad de Málaga
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0003-4314-6213"
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/FrancisRVillatoro/schwarzschild-one-particle-reproducibility"
url: "https://github.com/FrancisRVillatoro/schwarzschild-one-particle-reproducibility/releases/tag/v1.3.0"
abstract: >-
  Numerical and symbolic reproducibility package supporting three related studies
  of quantum fields near the Schwarzschild spacelike singularity: the universal
  Kasner scaling limit of Hadamard states, the scalar particle-number and
  one-particle-stress analysis, and the terminal dynamics and spin-rotation
  obstruction of Weyl and Dirac fields.
keywords:
  - Schwarzschild black hole
  - black-hole interior
  - quantum field theory in curved spacetime
  - Kasner spacetime
  - Hadamard states
  - renormalized stress-energy tensor
  - adiabatic renormalization
  - Bogoliubov transformations
  - reproducible research
  - Dirac fields
  - CAR quasifree states
